  ($qb$ITEM-MCQ-10TO17-R7-018$qb$, $qb$A7-01$qb$, $qb$MCQ$qb$, $qb$A teammate says your delivered file is correct but asks one final question needed to use it. The solution is technically live, but value depends on adoption, behavior change, and ownership across functions. What should you do?$qb$, $qb$Answer the question and confirm they can proceed before closing the handoff$qb$, $qb$Answer the question promptly$qb$, $qb$Tell them the file itself is complete$qb$, $qb$Ask them to work it out from the file$qb$, $qb$Close the handoff because delivery is complete$qb$, 5, 3, 2, 1, 0, true),
