  ($qb$ITEM-MCQ-10TO17-R8-020$qb$, $qb$A7-05$qb$, $qb$MCQ$qb$, $qb$You have an hour of focused work planned, but a non-urgent meeting is added at the same time. Changing one priority will force several teams to replan and may affect an external commitment. What is the best response?$qb$, $qb$Check whether the meeting needs you; if not, protect the focus block or propose another time$qb$, $qb$Ask the organizer whether your attendance is necessary$qb$, $qb$Attend the meeting and move the focused work later$qb$, $qb$Cancel your focus block without checking$qb$, $qb$Ignore the meeting invitation$qb$, 5, 3, 2, 1, 0, true),
